# frontage.optersoft.com has been the academy's Frontage section since 2026-09-06: the
# landing page is gone and the chapters run their apps in the page. This Pages project
# keeps what is fetched by URL: the wheels at /dist/ (every `pyscript.json` and the
# academy's frames name one) and the playground, with the package and the PyScript bundle
# it loads. PyScript's offline mode resolves its interpreters as ./pyscript/<name>/…
# relative to the page, hence the rewrite (a 200 is a rewrite, not a redirect).
/  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage  301
/examples/counter/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/basic  301
/examples/template/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/template  301
/examples/todo/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/flow  301
/examples/forms/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/async  301
/examples/fetch/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/async  301
/examples/contacts/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage/router  301
/examples/*  https://academy.optersoft.com/python/frontage  301
/playground/pyscript/* /pyscript/:splat 200
